# ── Vendored third-party repos and archives ──────────────────────────────────
# Downloaded for reference, not part of this project.
# openvla-oft (moojink/openvla-oft, MIT) and vlsa-aegis are dependencies, not our code;
# see the "Dependencies not included here" section of README.md.
openvla-oft-main/
vlsa-aegis/
# ManiSkill-main.zip (233 MB) and ucl_grpo_results.tar.gz (897 MB) each exceed GitHub's
