figures/demo_videos/

# ── Project page ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# docs/ is published as a GitHub Pages site, so its copies of the demo clips have
# to be tracked even though videos/ and *.mp4 are ignored everywhere else. Order
# matters: the directory must be re-included before the files inside it can be.
!docs/videos/
!docs/videos/*.mp4

